{"articleNo":"2392","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2392&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010학년도 1학기 휴,복학 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.12.28","hit":"16683","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">★ 휴</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">복학 신청 안내 ★</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2010학년도 1학기 휴·복학신청을 인터넷으로 접수받</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">습니다. 안내문에&nbsp;따라 원스톱서비스에서 신청하시기 바라며, </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">휴·복학&nbsp; 확정</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> 여</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">부를 반드시 확인하여&nbsp;학적상의 불이익이 발생하지 않도록 하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">.<font color=\"#ff0000\">(등록금인상분 미납자는 휴복학 불가능)</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">1. 휴학 신청(인터넷 신청)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;</span>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">구&nbsp; 분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"58\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">일반 휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"364\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">군입대 휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"100\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"28\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">질병 휴학</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\" height=\"44\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">신청 기간</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"44\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2010. 2. 1(월) 10 : 00 ~ 2. 12(금) 23 : 59까지</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">※ 위 기간 경과 후에는&nbsp;학사서비스센터로 직접 방문 신청하여야 함.</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\" height=\"29\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">신청 방법</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"29\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">홈페이지→원스톱서비스 로그인→학적→휴학신청접수</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\" height=\"72\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">제출 서류</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"58\" height=\"72\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">없음</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"364\" height=\"26\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">입영통지서 사본 or 군복무확인서 사본</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"100\" height=\"26\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4주이상 진단서</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"364\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 학</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">번, 연락처를 기재하여 휴학신청 당일(24시까지) 제출.</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">서류 미제출자는 3일후 휴학신청 자동 취소됨.</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"100\" height=\"46\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\" height=\"102\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">제출 장소</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"102\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 학사서비스센터 방문or 팩스(054-478-7069)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 팩스로 제출한 학생 중 신청 익일 1시 이후 처리가 되어 있지 않은 학생은 팩스&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 도착여부를 반드시 확인 바람(☎ 054-478-7066)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">*군입대 휴학 후, 귀향조치 및 입영 거부된 학</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">생은&nbsp;즉시 학사관리팀으로 반드시 연락</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt; TEXT-INDENT: -10pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">바람.</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"66\" height=\"44\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">확정 여부</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"44\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 확정 : 휴학 신청 후(서류 제출 후) 다음날 오후 1시 이후</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">확인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 원스톱서비스 로그인→학적→학적 및 각종자료조회→학적변동내역</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림체’\">&nbsp;</span><p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;※ 군입대 휴학을 원하나 </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">입영통지서가 아직 나오지 않은 학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">은 우선 일반휴학을 신청하고</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;입영통지서가 나오는대로 팩스만 보내주시면 일반휴학에서 군입대휴학으로 변경됩니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;※ 유의사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 일반휴학 허가는 수업일수 1/4선(2010년 3월 26일)까지만 허용. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">휴학생도 2월 16일부터 19일까지 등록금 납부 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">(납부기간경과 후 납부할 수 없으며 장학금혜택도 받을 수 없음).</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 휴학생은 수강신청 불가.</span></p>\n<p cl